comment3.text=\n\ Act\ -\ do\ whatever\ the\ Ball\ wants\ to\ do.\ This\ method\ is\ called\ whenever\n\ the\ 'Act'\ or\ 'Run'\ button\ gets\ pressed\ in\ the\ environment.\n
